<title>UK: Vodafone names Clark CEO for Australasia.</title>
<headline>Vodafone names Clark CEO for Australasia.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British mobile phone operator Vodafone Group Plc said on Friday it had appointed Brian Clark as chief executive of Vodafone Australasia Pty.</p>
<p>Vodafone said Clark was recently chief executive at Telkom SA Ltd, the state-owned public telephone operator in South Africa. Clark takes up his post on September 1 this year.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
